[agent:result]       [`USE SCHEMA`]: https://docs.databricks.com/sql/language-manual/sql-ref-syntax-ddl-use-schema.html
[agent:result]     :param wait_timeout: str (optional)
[agent:result]       The time in seconds the call will wait for the statement's result set as `Ns`, where `N` can be set
[agent:result]       to 0 or to a value between 5 and 50.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]       When set to `0s`, the statement will execute in asynchronous mode and the call will not wait for the
